Alerts                                                                          
                                                                                
Alerts run on a hub. Connect to a hub for alerts:                               
                                                                                
  machine-monitor connect URL     pair this machine with a hub                  
  machine-monitor --hub URL       open the TUI against a hub                    
                                                                                
Or start one here with `machine-monitor hub`.                                   
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
